# FourFusion FLAG 2027 reproduction repository: never commit data, caches or private material.
# Team-only byte-exact backup of the Kaggle staging folders (embeds organisers' meta file and dev payloads).
# It is kept outside this tree (NOP_BTC_2026-11-20/_staging_backup/); these lines guard against a copy coming back.
_staging_backup/
**/_staging_backup/
**/_PRIVATE*/
# Runner work folders and outputs
ff_work/
**/ff_work/
FF_WORK/
# Python caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
# Data, checkpoints and score files live under FF_DATA (Drive), never in git
*.npy
*.npz
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.parquet
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.zipdata
*.wav
*.mp4
*.m4a
*.aac
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
# assembly/inputs/ holds the ten mode (c) files only in a private copy of the repository (see assembly/inputs/README.md)
assembly/inputs/*
!assembly/inputs/README.md
# Credentials
.env
*.env
kaggle.json
**/.kaggle/
